     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Life-threatening bleeding: IVIG 1 g/kg daily for 1-2 days, or anti-D immune globulin 75 mcg/kg IV once (Rh-positive, not splenectomized; can cause severe hemolysis and DIC)."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
